      "arabic": "١١١٦٤- الرباب بنت البراء\nبن معرور «١» .\nذكرها في «التّجريد» مجردة، وكأن مستند ذلك ما اشتهر أنه مات أبوها في عهد النبي ﷺ في أوائل الهجرة، فتكون من هذا القسم",
      "english": "11164 — al-Rabab bint al-Bara' ibn Ma'rur (1)\n\nShe is mentioned in al-Tajrid without further information. It appears that the basis for this is the well-known fact that her father died during the lifetime of the Prophet, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, in the early part of the Hijra; she would therefore belong to this section.",
